{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Comes Home"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Book of Memories"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le14ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past Tense and Past Continuous tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Did you bump your head in the accident? </br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: No. I was wearing my seatbelt when it happened."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For Simple Past, regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.</p> Irregular verbs change in different ways.</p> For Past Continuous, we add <span class=\"strong\">was/were</span> + verb\u201c<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>\u201d to verbs.</p> You use Past Continuous verbs to describe a longer action that is interrupted by a shorter action.</p> You use Simple Past verbs to describe the shorter action."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brake\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"braked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were braking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bump\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bumped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were bumping\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wear\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wore\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were wearing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"run\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ran\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were running\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"step\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stepped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were stepping\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"drive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"drove\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were driving\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were thinking\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to run someone over "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to knock someone down with a vehicle"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We almost ran someone over on our way to the Pyramids!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about injuries and accidents."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sprain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to twist and injure a joint in your body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I stepped into a hole and sprained my ankle"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ankle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the part of the foot that connects to the leg"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When you hurt your ankle, it is difficult to walk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "whiplash"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an injury caused by a sudden jerk to the head, typically in a car accident"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I didn't bump my head, but I had whiplash for a few days."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "injured"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "harmed; suffering from an injury"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We had an accident but no one got injured."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "seriously"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "badly; not lightly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Was anyone seriously injured?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "life-threatening"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "serious with the possibility of death as an outcome"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fortunately for Andrew, his injuries weren't life-threatening!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think about an event that happened the last time you were on vacation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "What happened? Was it funny? Scary? Was it an accident?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a blog entry or an e-mail to a friend (8-10 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the event. Remember to use the Past Continuous and Past Simple tenses"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your story aloud to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about an event that happened to me. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe the event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what I was doing when something else happened."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: So, tell me more about your trip to Egypt! Did you enjoy yourself?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: For sure! Cairo is a fascinating city. The people on the street were very nice. The traffic was crazy though.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: How were the drivers?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They were okay, but my tour guide almost ran someone over when we were driving to the Pyramids! He braked just in time.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Oh no! Did anyone get injured?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not seriously, thank goodness! I was wearing my seatbelt when it happened. I just had whiplash for a few days after. And the tour guide bumped his head on the windscreen!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Did it hurt? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not as much Vanessa's ankle at the Grand Canyon ...</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: What happened?", "id": 2, "time": "24500", "image": "engenn5le14ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She sprained her ankle badly when we were hiking by ourselves. She was looking at the map and she stepped into a hole!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Ouch! At least it wasn't life-threatening!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. Always look on the bright side ...", "id": 3, "time": "38500", "image": "engenn5le14ob06re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about injuries and accidents. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can say what I was doing when something else happened. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What's the most exciting thing that happened to you on a vacation? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Did you ever have an accident when you were on a vacation? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "The vacation was exciting! Here's what happened ..."}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id"